# Keep repository bytes deterministic across Windows/macOS/Linux clones.  Arenyxa's
# SOURCE_MANIFEST.sha256 hashes tracked source bytes, so checkout-time CRLF conversion
# must not silently invalidate integrity verification.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Explicit binary assets/payloads.
*.ico binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.zip binary
*.pdf binary
